@startuml
title Proposed expense and receipt data flow — shared product
actor Member
participant "Web/mobile client" as Client
participant "Application service" as App
participant "Domain rules" as Domain
database "Transactional store" as Store
collections "Outbox" as Outbox
participant "Receipt object store" as Receipt
participant "Notification worker" as Notify
Member -> Client: enter expense, choose members
Client -> App: submit authenticated command
App -> Domain: authorize and validate
Domain --> App: accepted facts and exact shares
App -> Receipt: store optional private image
App -> Store: expense + shares + approval plan
App -> Outbox: recipient events
App -> Store: commit
App --> Client: pending status
Outbox -> Notify: dispatch after commit
Notify -> Member: notice to other group members
note over App,Store: Receipt reference and expense write need a failure policy
note over App,Store: Partial object upload cleanup remains undecided
@enduml
